{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_4_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，王二月，莒人伐杞，取牟婁。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"傳曰：言伐言取，所惡也。諸侯相伐，取地於是始，故謹而志之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"二、戊申，衞祝吁弒其君完。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"大夫弒其君，以國氏者，嫌也，弒而代之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"三、夏，公及宋公遇於清。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"及者，內為志焉爾。遇者，志相得也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"四、宋公、陳侯、蔡人、衞人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"五、秋，翬帥師會宋公、陳侯、蔡人、衞人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"翬者何也？公子翬也。其不稱公子何也？貶之也。何為貶之也？與於弒公，故貶之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"六、九月，衞人殺祝吁於濮。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"稱人以殺，殺有罪也。其月，謹之也。祝吁之挈，失嫌也。於濮者，譏失賊也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月，衞人立晉。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_4_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_4","textTraditional":"衞人者，眾辭也。立者，不宜立者也。晉之名，惡也。其稱人以立之何也？得眾也。得眾則是賢也。賢則其曰不宜立何也？春秋之義，諸侯與正不與賢也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}